A scorned woman's revenge is terrifying.

264
00:13:50,829 --> 00:13:53,457
My former boss had an affair,
and his wife almost stabbed him.

265
00:13:53,541 --> 00:13:54,875
Wait, seriously?

266
00:13:54,959 --> 00:13:57,753
-That's terrifying!
-Hey, don't say that in front of him.

267
00:13:57,836 --> 00:14:00,506
Are you getting a divorce?
Have you even talked to her?

268
00:14:00,589 --> 00:14:03,509
He ran here right after
the articles came out.

269
00:14:03,592 --> 00:14:04,802
So I bet they haven't talked.

270
00:14:04,885 --> 00:14:06,387
No, I mean…

271
00:14:06,470 --> 00:14:08,722
Well, no.

272
00:14:10,182 --> 00:14:11,225
What? Who is it?

273
00:14:11,850 --> 00:14:14,019
Who is it?!

274
00:14:16,146 --> 00:14:17,064
Yes?

275
00:14:17,606 --> 00:14:20,484
My apologies for showing up unannounced.

276
00:14:22,152 --> 00:14:23,529
Who might you be?

277
00:14:24,238 --> 00:14:25,656
I am…

278
00:14:26,323 --> 00:14:28,409
Jin Ichijo's wife.

279
00:14:31,412 --> 00:14:32,621
Is…

280
00:14:33,289 --> 00:14:34,748
my husband here?

281
00:14:54,476 --> 00:14:56,312
You too. You came here…

282
00:14:56,395 --> 00:14:58,772
to take a vacation, didn't you?

283
00:14:58,856 --> 00:15:00,274
<i>What are we going to do?</i>

284
00:15:00,357 --> 00:15:02,192
<i>To think his wife would come here…</i>

285
00:15:02,276 --> 00:15:04,153
<i>This will be a bloodbath.</i>

286
00:15:04,236 --> 00:15:06,655
Idiot!

287
00:15:07,656 --> 00:15:09,617
<i>-Check if there's a weapon inside!</i>
<i>-Yes!</i>

288
00:15:09,700 --> 00:15:11,827
It's better than going to hell, right?

289
00:15:11,911 --> 00:15:13,287
Just what are you?

290
00:15:14,079 --> 00:15:15,372
No!

291
00:15:15,456 --> 00:15:17,291
Wait, no. Bad, that's bad.

292
00:15:17,374 --> 00:15:18,500
Seriously?

293
00:15:18,584 --> 00:15:21,712
-Ryoko!
-Darling!

294
00:15:22,296 --> 00:15:23,589
Romance, huh.

295
00:15:23,672 --> 00:15:27,009
<i>Midori, you seriously</i>
<i>need to get a boyfriend soon!</i>

296
00:15:29,553 --> 00:15:30,512
Subtitle translation by: Nix S.
